{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshNotificationServiceExtension"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Minimal integration — no code required beyond the subclass:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import PushwooshFramework","","class NotificationService: PushwooshNotificationServiceExtension {}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Or point the extension’s Info.plist "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"},{"text":" at","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PushwooshNotificationServiceExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly and write no Swift\/Obj-C at all.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Requirements:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Pushwoosh_APPID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the main app Info.plist. You do not need to duplicate it in the extension"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist — when missing there, Pushwoosh inherits it (and other "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pushwoosh_*"},{"text":" keys) from the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host app. Set it explicitly in the extension Info.plist only to override the host."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"mutable-content: 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the push payload (so the extension is invoked)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Group shared between the app and the extension for badge \/ reverse-proxy sync"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_APP_GROUPS_NAME"},{"type":"text","text":" in Info.plist or override "},{"code":"pushwooshAppGroupsName","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Note: if the host app uses a reverse proxy (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pushwoosh_ALLOW_REVERSE_PROXY"},{"type":"text","text":"), the extension"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"needs this App Group to read the proxy URL the app stored there — otherwise the delivery event","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is held back (it will not bypass the proxy). Add the App Group capability to the extension target."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Customization, from least to most control:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pushwooshAppGroupsName"},{"text":" to set the App Group programmatically.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pushwooshPrepareForRequest:completion:"},{"text":" to run async preparation before processing","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(e.g. Push Stories media prefetch) without touching the standard ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Override the standard "},{"code":"didReceiveNotificationRequest:withContentHandler:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to customize the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content before it is shown: call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"super"},{"text":" with your own content handler, mutate the content","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside it, then forward to the original handler. Pushwoosh still runs t